###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The paper gives 'jmax = 6'; whether this is j or 2j in the SNAP convention is not stated, so no twoJmax value is recorded. The energy and force MAEs given in eV are converted to meV; the stress MAE (eV/A3) has unit null.
# - The validation and test sets are reported together ('validation/test set'), so the role is test with that label.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
